91845_2022791841535994_6381591123241693989_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IZB-Px0H-5YQ7kNvwGYWxJ7&_nc_oc=AdoZ5RpTMkZgP_lnR9LPNyaDMacI8HqIevBxDLFj7VA1TB_w_xvBH3KVApZNXx6FjT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHlTr_EP2PJZbLw8ieQ-5I1tV8itkxBWh1o5UB9d1D7Ng&oe=6A8ECC29"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "650141244188879", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391716_650141250855545_8040660470448703299_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zT14UVBWdVkQ7kNvwEq8X7Y&_nc_oc=AdpxBFLMVi1M-0YYF_24XCPT8zQOpoDsnPSghyXS2v1Jdf7iX3S5y15f_HNHSbz316M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFxf_uW9JmXNaMkhfnR4taJU2KPM4z4YdSvbr9DZQLSqQ&oe=6A8EE300"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "659135163455703", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393463_659135170122369_7227157406125140691_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xkQJ4EjC0LkQ7kNvwHdRjxq&_nc_oc=AdqNl9H0TaH-tttfOPlU4MNZlQzeih5ORUWIcE364MsPKakGPP7YUyRzrGlkhRyV_P8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGCDNOD1bqWc6a2gL0oo6AtLMhVIVzCO-vOxh7nPnjvNw&oe=6A8EC424"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1303847337568193", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393059_1303847340901526_2938449234628070226_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_P17cQIX9doQ7kNvwGYNOIB&_nc_oc=AdpVFvUImYdK4qsRjW-_j3Pjdz9hNS3a6z8obugKmbdGB8abVRKJ04i_UVbDFN5i0AE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGe5EP3xXA4QXiHmGTUxIV2mKUXUxUnDc2h5o2NSboIOw&oe=6A8EE7EA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PosterVideoTriler.png", "id": "2298977923791758", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391888_2298977927125091_343536883905062208_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RUQg3IytxzoQ7kNvwF4rR0W&_nc_oc=Adp7-6lvEsGJZ6nhs2-Nxb50cB5S9O_lr6fCeZyqp8kyNDtFFf2Ur_qDmD6VVz3V-To&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEVrphqEZ0mhIqymmPdmKPyvqC4XuGaIFnFCvf8F4lsCQ&oe=6A8EF9F8"}, "display_name": "Hellfire Rampage", "keywords": ["Fighting", "shooter", "Action", "demons", "combat"], "long_description": "HELLFIRE RAMPAGE VR is an action-based combat game that blends shooting and melee fighting mechanics.\n\nYou are a genius portal inventor who has detected an abnormal signal from another world.\nAfter investigating, you discover that hellish creatures are collecting magical crystal essences and preparing to invade the HUMANITY\n\n-> YOUR MISSION IS TO STOP THEIR INVASION AND COLLECT THE CRYSTALS !\n\nUse your ability to slow time and take on powerful enemies in intense battles.\n[BULLET TIME + DASH] is a toxic combination for tactical movements and survival.\n\n-> REFLECT BULLETS BACK BY RICOCHET WITH ANY WEAPON\n\nCombine a magic wand with a talisman or a shotgun with a sickle.\nLaunch fireballs, swing a lightsaber, throw shurikens, or even play a demonic kalimba.\nThe arsenal is packed with epic gear, from chainsaws to crossbows and beyond!\nGet ready to test around 30+ non-trivial guns!\n\n\nFace dangerous hordes and destroy their source.\nPrepare to meet skeletons, imps, demons, hellhounds and mad ravens,\nundead summon kings, skull queens, giant devils, toxic moths and others...\n\n-> HELL CREATURES WILL NOT LET YOU TO GET BORED!\n\nThe most thrilling and intense fights are waiting for you.\n\nAround 70+ challenges from different mysterious locations\n\n-> GET READY TO SWEAT IN MORTAL CHALLENGES\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Are you brave enough to challenge the HELL?", "short_description": "Hellfire Rampage VR - true and hot battle against hordes of demons!\n\n- Find magical essences to boost your power.\n- Use slow-motion and dash jumps to destroy enemies.\n- Try over 30 epic and unique weapons.\n- Face terrifying hellish creatures with their own combat mechanics.\n\nYou are humanity\u2019s last hope - defeat the undead army and survive!"}]},